function [nu] = shadow_fraction(r_sat, r_sun)
%SHADOW_FRACTION  The sunlit fraction nu of the Sun's disc seen from r_sat, the Sun at r_sun (both geocentric, the same frame).
%   vectors: 160
%   r_sat: real[m][3] (passed in m)
